  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "cathedral-meet",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "You're awake! I'm Myrie. I watched the light come down on the Cathedral last night, and I knew someone new had arrived.",
      "next": "cm-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cm-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "You look like you've been through a storm. Come on, I'll show you around town. It helps, honestly.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "townsquare-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Ready for the tour? There's so much to see!",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Lead the way.",
          "next": "townsquare-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "townsquare"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "townsquare-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Follow me! Market first. It's just north, past the Cathedral. Try to keep up!",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 280,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tour-market",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "This is the market. Food, tools, gossip: if it's for sale, it's here. Penwick's bookshop is on the corner, and the Gilded Cog does the best stew in Trifectia.",
      "next": "tour-market-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tour-crafts",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The workshops. Fishing, cooking, mining, smithing, crafting, gathering: there's a teacher for each, if you're willing to get your hands dirty.",
      "next": "tour-crafts-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tour-gate",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "And the gate. Mines to the east, forest to the south. Everything past here gets a little less friendly.",
      "next": "tour-end",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tour-end",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "That's Tricode! If you need work, come find me by the fountains. There's always something.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 560,
        "y": 450
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rat-problem-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The miners are in a state. Rats, everywhere in the tunnels. Nobody can work.",
      "next": "rat-problem-o1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rat-problem-o1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Could you clear them out?",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "I'll handle it.",
          "next": "rat-problem-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "rat-problem"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rat-problem-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "You're a lifesaver. Foreman Grell runs the mine.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 840,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secret-book-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Can I ask a strange favour? I'm looking for a children's book: The Great Benefactor.",
      "next": "secret-book-o1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secret-book-o1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "My mother read it to me. I'd like to read it again. Penwick might have it.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "I'll ask Penwick.",
          "next": "secret-book-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "secret-book"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "secret-book-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Thank you! It's silly, I know.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1120,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "book-wrong",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "That's... not it. The pictures are the same, but the ending is wrong.",
      "next": "bw-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1400,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bw-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "In my mother's copy, the Benefactor and the Primordial were drawn in the same shadow. I always thought it was a mistake by the printer.",
      "next": "bw-3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1400,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bw-3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Penwick said there might be an old reading room? Please try.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1400,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "book-read",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "This is it! Look: the last page. One shadow, two names.",
      "next": "br-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1680,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "br-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Why would the Cathedral collect all of these? It's just a children's book... isn't it?",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1680,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-outback-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "I've got too much on my plate right now. Could you find my brother, Drali? He hunts in the forest to the south.",
      "next": "the-outback-o1",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-outback-o1",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "He hasn't been to town in weeks. That isn't like him.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "I'll find him.",
          "next": "the-outback-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "the-outback"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-outback-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Thank you. Tell him to come home sometime.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 1960,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "army",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "There you are! I just got back. You need to hear this.",
      "next": "army-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2240,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "army-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "An army of monsters is marching on the city next door. Goblins, trolls, things I don't have names for. They'll reach the walls by nightfall.",
      "next": "army-3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2240,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "army-3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The city needs everyone who can hold a blade. Please.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2240,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-new-city-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "I'm back! And I have news. Bad news.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Tell me.",
          "next": "a-new-city-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "a-new-city"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2520,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a-new-city-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Then listen.",
      "next": "army",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2520,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eta-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The army had a leader. I saw them from the walls.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Who?",
          "next": "eta-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "eta"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2800,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eta-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Let me tell you what I saw.",
      "next": "eta-warning",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 2800,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eta-warning",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Small. Masked. Moving so fast the goblins scattered just to stay out of the way.",
      "next": "ew-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ew-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "The soldiers are calling them Eta. One of the Emperors.",
      "next": "ew-3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ew-3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Be careful. Please.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eta-after",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "You're alive! You actually beat an Emperor!",
      "next": "ea-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3360,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ea-2",
      "speaker": "player",
      "text": "When the mask cracked... there was a person under it. Just a person.",
      "next": "ea-3",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3360,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ea-3",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "That can't be right. The Emperors aren't people. They can't be.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3360,
        "y": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-bazaar-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Argon is just over the hills. The biggest bazaar in the Layland! Come with me?",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Let's go.",
          "next": "the-bazaar-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "the-bazaar"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3640,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-bazaar-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "You'll love it.",
      "next": "bazaar-tour",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3640,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bazaar-tour",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Welcome to Argon! Spices, steel, silk, spellbooks: if it exists, someone here is selling it.",
      "next": "bt-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3920,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bt-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "And if they're not selling it, you can bid on it. The auction stalls are run by Broker Sallow.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 3920,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "masked-individual-o0",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Don't turn around. Someone in a mask has been following us since the spice stalls.",
      "next": null,
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "Let's find out who.",
          "next": "masked-individual-ok",
          "when": [],
          "effects": [
            {
              "kind": "startQuest",
              "quest": "masked-individual"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Not right now.",
          "next": null,
          "when": [],
          "effects": []
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 4200,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "masked-individual-ok",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "Carefully.",
      "next": "tail",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 4200,
        "y": 150
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tail",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "There, by the fountain. Gone again. They're good.",
      "next": "tail-2",
      "options": [],
      "effects": [],
      "pos": {
        "x": 4480,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tail-2",
      "speaker": "npc",
      "text": "They went into the back alleys. Let's follow, but watch your back.",
      "next": null,
